<title>USA: United Auto Group Q3 shr $0.33 vs $0.29.</title>
<headline>United Auto Group Q3 shr $0.33 vs $0.29.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>UNITED AUTO GROUP, INC.</p>
<p>			Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>					    (unaudited)</p>
<p>				    ($ Thousands, except EPS data)</p>
<p>				   COMPARATIVE - PRO FORMA (a)</p>
<p>				    3rd Quarter	     Nine Months</p>
<p>				1996	1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p>Total Revenues	  425,905   378,080   1,226,535  1,017,066</p>
<p>Operating Income(Loss) 11,011    10,024	30,591     19,230</p>
<p>Net Income		 $5,885    $5,263     $16,422     $9,615</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share	$0.33     $0.29	 $0.92	$0.54</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) The Consolidated Statements of Operations for all periods have been restated to reflect the Company's completion of its initial public offering of 6,250,000 shares on October 28, 1996 and the contemporaneous acquisitions of Sun Automotive Group, Evans Automotive Group and Standefer Motor Sales.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
